#: ../../source/tor.rst:2
msgid "Connecting to Tor"
msgstr "Menghubungkan ke Tor"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:4
msgid ""
"When OnionShare starts, it will show you a screen asking you to connect to "
"the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Saat OnionShare dimulai, aplikasi akan menampilkan layar yang meminta Anda "
"untuk terhubung ke jaringan Tor."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can toggle on the switch \"Connect to Tor automatically\" before "
"clicking \"Connect to Tor\". This means that next time OnionShare starts, it "
"will automatically connect with its Tor connection settings from the last "
"session, instead of presenting you with the connection options. If the "
"connection fails, you can still try bridges or reconfigure Tor via the "
"\"Network Settings\" button."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengaktifkan sakelar \"Connect to Tor automatically\" sebelum "
"mengeklik \"Connect to Tor\". Dengan demikian, saat OnionShare dijalankan "
"kembali, aplikasi akan otomatis terhubung menggunakan pengaturan koneksi Tor "
"dari sesi terakhir, alih-alih menampilkan pilihan koneksi. Jika koneksi "
"gagal, Anda tetap dapat mencoba bridge atau mengonfigurasi ulang Tor melalui "
"tombol \"Network Settings\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:11
msgid ""
"You can click \"Connect to Tor\" to begin the connection process. If there "
"are no problems with your network, including any attempts to block your "
"access to the Tor network, this should hopefully work the first time."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengeklik \"Connect to Tor\" untuk memulai proses koneksi. Jika "
"tidak ada masalah pada jaringan Anda, termasuk upaya pemblokiran akses ke "
"jaringan Tor, koneksi seharusnya dapat berhasil pada percobaan pertama."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:13
msgid ""
"Or, if you want to manually configure Bridges or other Tor settings before "
"you connect, you can click \"Network Settings\"."
msgstr ""
"Atau, jika Anda ingin mengonfigurasi Bridge atau pengaturan Tor lainnya "
"secara manual sebelum terhubung, Anda dapat mengeklik \"Network Settings\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:16
msgid "Automatic censorship circumvention"
msgstr "Penghindaran sensor secara otomatis"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:18
msgid ""
"When you click \"Connect to Tor\", if OnionShare fails to connect, it might "
"be because Tor is censored in your country or on your local network."
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda mengeklik \"Connect to Tor\", jika OnionShare gagal terhubung, "
"kemungkinan Tor disensor di negara Anda atau pada jaringan lokal Anda."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:20
msgid "If this occurs, you will have these choices:"
msgstr "Jika hal ini terjadi, Anda akan memiliki pilihan berikut:"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:22
msgid "Try again without a bridge"
msgstr "Coba lagi tanpa bridge"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:23
msgid ""
"Automatically determine my country from my IP address for bridge settings"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan negara saya secara otomatis dari alamat IP saya untuk pengaturan "
"bridge"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:24
msgid "Manually select my country for bridge settings"
msgstr "Pilih negara saya secara manual untuk pengaturan bridge"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you choose the \"Try again without a bridge\" option, OnionShare will "
"retry connecting to Tor like normal, without attempting to bypass censorship."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memilih opsi \"Try again without a bridge\", OnionShare akan "
"mencoba kembali terhubung ke Tor seperti biasa, tanpa berupaya melewati "
"sensor."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:30
msgid ""
"The other two options will attempt to automatically bypass censorship using "
"Tor bridges. If your network provider is blocking access to the Tor network, "
"you can hopefully still connect to a Tor bridge, which will then connect you "
"to the Tor network, circumventing the censorship. Both of these options use "
"the Tor Project's Censorship Circumvention API to provide you with bridge "
"settings that should work for you. OnionShare will temporarily use the `Meek "
"<https://gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/meek/>`_ domain-"
"fronting proxy to make a non-Tor connection from your computer to Tor's "
"Censorship Circumvention API. The Meek proxy hides the fact that you are "
"trying to find a way to connect to Tor."
msgstr ""
"Dua opsi lainnya akan berupaya melewati sensor secara otomatis menggunakan "
"bridge Tor. Jika penyedia jaringan Anda memblokir akses ke jaringan Tor, "
"Anda mungkin tetap dapat terhubung ke bridge Tor, yang kemudian akan "
"menghubungkan Anda ke jaringan Tor dan melewati sensor tersebut. Kedua opsi "
"ini menggunakan Censorship Circumvention API milik Tor Project untuk "
"menyediakan pengaturan bridge yang seharusnya dapat berfungsi bagi Anda. "
"OnionShare akan menggunakan proxy domain-fronting `Meek <https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/meek/>`_ sementara untuk "
"membuat koneksi non-Tor dari komputer Anda ke Censorship Circumvention API "
"milik Tor. Proxy Meek menyembunyikan fakta bahwa Anda sedang mencoba mencari "
"cara untuk terhubung ke Tor."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:36
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Automatically determine my country from my IP address for "
"bridge settings\", the Censorship Circumvention API will consider your IP "
"address (yes, your real IP address) to determine what country you might "
"reside in. Based on the country information, the API will try to "
"automatically find bridges that suit your location."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memilih \"Automatically determine my country from my IP address "
"for bridge settings\", Censorship Circumvention API akan mempertimbangkan "
"alamat IP Anda—ya, alamat IP asli Anda—untuk menentukan negara tempat Anda "
"mungkin berada. Berdasarkan informasi negara tersebut, API akan berupaya "
"secara otomatis menemukan bridge yang sesuai dengan lokasi Anda."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:41
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Manually select my country for bridge settings\", the "
"Censorship API will find the bridges that suit the country that you "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memilih \"Manually select my country for bridge settings\", "
"Censorship API akan menemukan bridge yang sesuai dengan negara yang Anda "
"tentukan."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:46
msgid "How automatic censorship circumvention works"
msgstr "Cara kerja penghindaran sensor otomatis"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:48
msgid ""
"If the Censorship Circumvention API finds bridges that it believes will suit "
"you, OnionShare will try to reconnect to Tor using those bridges. If the API "
"does not find any bridges for your location, OnionShare will ask the API for "
"\"fallback\" options, and then try to reconnect using those."
msgstr ""
"Jika Censorship Circumvention API menemukan bridge yang diyakini sesuai "
"untuk Anda, OnionShare akan mencoba kembali terhubung ke Tor menggunakan "
"bridge tersebut. Jika API tidak menemukan bridge untuk lokasi Anda, "
"OnionShare akan meminta opsi \"fallback\" kepada API, kemudian mencoba "
"kembali terhubung menggunakan opsi tersebut."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:50
msgid ""
"If for some reason OnionShare fails to connect to the Censorship API itself, "
"or if the API returns an error message, OnionShare will attempt to use the "
"obfs4 built-in bridges."
msgstr ""
"Jika karena alasan tertentu OnionShare gagal terhubung ke Censorship API itu "
"sendiri, atau jika API mengembalikan pesan kesalahan, OnionShare akan "
"mencoba menggunakan bridge bawaan obfs4."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:52
msgid ""
"It's important to note that the requests to the Censorship Circumvention API "
"do not go over the Tor network (because if you could connect to Tor already, "
"you wouldn't need to connect to the API)."
msgstr ""
"Penting untuk diperhatikan bahwa permintaan ke Censorship Circumvention API "
"tidak dikirim melalui jaringan Tor, karena jika Anda sudah dapat terhubung "
"ke Tor, Anda tidak perlu terhubung ke API tersebut."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:54
msgid ""
"Even though it's hard for an adversary to discover where the Meek request is "
"going, this may still be risky for some users. Therefore, it is an opt-in "
"feature. The use of Meek and non-torified network requests are limited only "
"to making one or two requests to the Censorship Circumvention API. Then Meek "
"is stopped, and all further network requests happen over the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun sulit bagi pihak lawan untuk mengetahui tujuan permintaan Meek, hal "
"ini tetap dapat berisiko bagi sebagian pengguna. Oleh karena itu, fitur ini "
"bersifat opt-in. Penggunaan Meek dan permintaan jaringan non-Tor dibatasi "
"hanya untuk membuat satu atau dua permintaan ke Censorship Circumvention "
"API. Setelah itu, Meek dihentikan dan seluruh permintaan jaringan "
"selanjutnya dilakukan melalui jaringan Tor."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:56
msgid ""
"If you are uncomfortable with making a request that doesn't go over the Tor "
"network, you can click \"Network Settings\" (or the Settings icon in the "
"bottom right corner, followed by the Tor Settings tab in the screen that "
"appears), and manually configure bridges. After you save any bridge "
"settings, OnionShare will try to reconnect using those bridges."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda tidak nyaman membuat permintaan yang tidak melalui jaringan Tor, "
"Anda dapat mengeklik \"Network Settings\"—atau ikon Settings di pojok kanan "
"bawah, lalu memilih tab Tor Settings pada layar yang muncul—dan "
"mengonfigurasi bridge secara manual. Setelah menyimpan pengaturan bridge, "
"OnionShare akan mencoba kembali terhubung menggunakan bridge tersebut."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:59
msgid "Manually configure Tor settings"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi pengaturan Tor secara manual"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can get to the Tor settings by clicking \"Network Settings\" on the "
"welcome screen, or by clicking the \"⚙\" icon in the bottom-right corner of "
"the application, and then switch to the Tor Settings tab in the screen that "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat membuka pengaturan Tor dengan mengeklik \"Network Settings\" pada "
"layar selamat datang, atau dengan mengeklik ikon \"⚙\" di pojok kanan bawah "
"aplikasi, kemudian beralih ke tab Tor Settings pada layar yang muncul."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:65
msgid ""
"Here are the different ways you can configure OnionShare to connect to Tor:"
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah berbagai cara untuk mengonfigurasi OnionShare agar terhubung "
"ke Tor:"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:68
msgid "Use the Tor version built into OnionShare"
msgstr "Gunakan versi Tor yang terintegrasi dalam OnionShare"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:70
msgid ""
"This is the default, simplest and most reliable way that OnionShare connects "
"to Tor. For this reason, it's recommended for most users."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah cara bawaan, paling sederhana, dan paling andal bagi OnionShare "
"untuk terhubung ke Tor. Oleh karena itu, metode ini direkomendasikan bagi "
"sebagian besar pengguna."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:73
msgid ""
"When you open OnionShare, it launches an already configured ``tor`` process "
"in the background for OnionShare to use. It doesn't interfere with other "
"``tor`` processes on your computer, so you can use the Tor Browser or the "
"system ``tor`` on their own."
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda membuka OnionShare, aplikasi akan menjalankan proses ``tor`` yang "
"sudah dikonfigurasi di latar belakang untuk digunakan oleh OnionShare. "
"Proses ini tidak mengganggu proses ``tor`` lain di komputer Anda, sehingga "
"Anda tetap dapat menggunakan Tor Browser atau ``tor`` sistem secara terpisah."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:76
msgid "**Using bridges**"
msgstr "**Menggunakan bridge**"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:78
msgid ""
"To use a bridge, you must select \"Use the Tor version built into "
"OnionShare\" and check the \"Use a bridge\" checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan bridge, Anda harus memilih \"Use the Tor version built "
"into OnionShare\" dan mencentang kotak \"Use a bridge\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:80
msgid ""
"Try using a built-in bridge first. Using `obfs4` or `snowflake` bridges is "
"recommended over using `meek`."
msgstr ""
"Cobalah menggunakan bridge bawaan terlebih dahulu. Penggunaan bridge `obfs4` "
"atau `snowflake` direkomendasikan dibandingkan `meek-azure`."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:84
msgid ""
"If using a built-in bridge doesn't work, you can request a bridge from "
"torproject.org. You will have to solve a CAPTCHA in order to request a "
"bridge. (This makes it more difficult for governments or ISPs to block "
"access to Tor bridges.)"
msgstr ""
"Jika bridge bawaan tidak berfungsi, Anda dapat meminta bridge dari "
"torproject.org. Anda harus menyelesaikan CAPTCHA untuk meminta bridge. (Hal "
"ini membuat pemerintah atau ISP lebih sulit memblokir akses ke bridge Tor.)"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:88
msgid ""
"You also have the option of using a bridge that you learned about from a "
"trusted source."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menggunakan bridge yang diperoleh dari sumber tepercaya."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:91
msgid "Attempt auto-configuration with Tor Browser"
msgstr "Mencoba konfigurasi otomatis dengan Tor Browser"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:93
msgid ""
"If you have `downloaded the Tor Browser <https://www.torproject.org>`_ and "
"don't want two ``tor`` processes running, you can use the ``tor`` process "
"from the Tor Browser. Keep in mind you need to keep Tor Browser open in the "
"background while you're using OnionShare for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda telah `mengunduh Tor Browser <https://www.torproject.org>`_ dan "
"tidak ingin menjalankan dua proses ``tor``, Anda dapat menggunakan proses "
"``tor`` dari Tor Browser. Perlu diingat bahwa Tor Browser harus tetap "
"terbuka di latar belakang selama Anda menggunakan OnionShare agar metode ini "
"berfungsi."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:97
msgid "Using a system ``tor`` in Windows"
msgstr "Menggunakan ``tor`` sistem di Windows"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:99
msgid ""
"This is fairly advanced. You'll need to know how edit plaintext files and do "
"stuff as an administrator."
msgstr ""
"Metode ini cukup lanjutan. Anda perlu mengetahui cara mengedit file teks "
"biasa dan menjalankan tindakan sebagai administrator."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:101
msgid ""
"Download the Tor Windows Expert Bundle `from the Tor website <https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/tor/>`_. Extract the compressed file and copy "
"the extracted folder to ``C:\\Program Files (x86)\\`` Rename the extracted "
"folder with ``Data`` and ``Tor`` in it to ``tor-win32``."
msgstr ""
"Unduh Tor Windows Expert Bundle `dari situs web Tor <https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/tor/>`_. Ekstrak file terkompresi tersebut, lalu "
"salin folder hasil ekstraksi ke ``C:Program Files (x86)``. Ubah nama folder "
"hasil ekstraksi yang berisi ``Data`` dan ``Tor`` menjadi ``tor-win32``."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:105
msgid ""
