"``comprised stumble rummage work avenging construct volatile`` is a good "
"idea for a password.) Now open a command prompt (``cmd``) as an "
"administrator, and use ``tor.exe --hash-password`` to generate a hash of "
"your password. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Buat kata sandi untuk control port. (Sebaiknya gunakan rangkaian tujuh kata, "
"seperti ``comprised stumble rummage work avenging construct volatile``, "
"sebagai kata sandi.) Selanjutnya, buka Command Prompt (``cmd``) sebagai "
"administrator dan gunakan ``tor.exe --hash-password`` untuk menghasilkan "
"hash kata sandi Anda. Contoh::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:112
msgid ""
"The hashed password output is displayed after some warnings (which you can "
"ignore). In the case of the above example, it is "
"``16:00322E903D96DE986058BB9ABDA91E010D7A863768635AC38E213FDBEF``."
msgstr ""
"Output kata sandi yang telah di-hash ditampilkan setelah beberapa peringatan "
"yang dapat Anda abaikan. Pada contoh di atas, hasilnya adalah "
"``16:00322E903D96DE986058BB9ABDA91E010D7A863768635AC38E213FDBEF``."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:114
msgid ""
"Now create a new text file at ``C:\\Program Files (x86)\\tor-win32\\torrc`` "
"and put your hashed password output in it, replacing the "
"``HashedControlPassword`` with the one you just generated::"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang buat file teks baru di ``C:\\Program Files (x86)\\tor-win32\\t"
"orrc`` , lalu masukkan output hash kata sandi Anda ke dalamnya dengan "
"mengganti ``HashedControlPassword`` menggunakan hash yang baru saja Anda "
"buat::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:119
msgid ""
"In your administrator command prompt, install ``tor`` as a service using the "
"appropriate ``torrc`` file you just created (as described in `<https://"
"2019.www.torproject.org/docs/faq.html.en#NTService>`_). Like this::"
msgstr ""
"Dalam Command Prompt yang dijalankan sebagai administrator, instal ``tor`` "
"sebagai layanan menggunakan file ``torrc`` yang sesuai dan baru saja Anda "
"buat (sebagaimana dijelaskan dalam `<https://2019.www.torproject.org/docs/"
"faq.html.en#NTService>`_). Contohnya::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:123
msgid "You are now running a system ``tor`` process in Windows!"
msgstr "Sekarang Anda menjalankan proses ``tor`` sistem di Windows."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:125
msgid ""
"Open OnionShare, click the \"⚙\" icon in it, and switch to the Tor Settings "
"tab. Under \"How should OnionShare connect to Tor?\" choose \"Connect using "
"control port\", and set \"Control port\" to ``127.0.0.1`` and \"Port\" to "
"``9051``. Under \"Tor authentication settings\" choose \"Password\" and set "
"the password to the control port password you picked above. Click the \"Test "
"Connection to Tor\" button. If all goes well, you should see \"Connected to "
"the Tor controller\"."
msgstr ""
"Buka OnionShare, klik ikon \"⚙\", lalu beralih ke tab Tor Settings. Pada "
"bagian \"How should OnionShare connect to Tor?\", pilih \"Connect using "
"control port\", kemudian atur \"Control port\" menjadi ``127.0.0.1`` dan "
"\"Port\" menjadi ``9051``. Pada bagian \"Tor authentication settings\", "
"pilih \"Password\", lalu masukkan kata sandi control port yang Anda pilih "
"sebelumnya. Klik tombol \"Test Connection to Tor\". Jika semuanya berjalan "
"lancar, Anda akan melihat pesan \"Connected to the Tor controller\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:134
msgid "Using a system ``tor`` in macOS"
msgstr "Menggunakan ``tor`` sistem di macOS"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:136
msgid ""
"First, install `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_ if you don't already have it, "
"and then install Tor::"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, instal `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_ jika belum tersedia, kemudian "
"instal Tor::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:140
msgid "Now configure Tor to allow connections from OnionShare::"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, konfigurasikan Tor agar mengizinkan koneksi dari OnionShare::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:147
msgid "And start the system Tor service::"
msgstr "Kemudian, jalankan layanan Tor sistem::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:151
msgid ""
"Open OnionShare, click the \"⚙\" icon in it, and switch to the Tor Settings "
"tab. Under \"How should OnionShare connect to Tor?\" choose \"Connect using "
"socket file\", and set the socket file to be ``/usr/local/var/run/tor/"
"control.socket``. Under \"Tor authentication settings\" choose \"No "
"authentication, or cookie authentication\". Click the \"Test Connection to "
"Tor\" button."
msgstr ""
"Buka OnionShare, klik ikon \"⚙\", lalu beralih ke tab Tor Settings. Pada "
"bagian \"How should OnionShare connect to Tor?\", pilih \"Connect using "
"socket file\", lalu atur file socket menjadi ``/usr/local/var/run/tor/"
"control.socket``. Pada bagian \"Tor authentication settings\", pilih \"No "
"authentication, or cookie authentication\". Klik tombol \"Test Connection to "
"Tor\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:157 ../../source/tor.rst:177
msgid "If all goes well, you should see \"Connected to the Tor controller\"."
msgstr ""
"Jika semuanya berjalan lancar, Anda akan melihat pesan \"Connected to the "
"Tor controller\"."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:160
msgid "Using a system ``tor`` in Linux"
msgstr "Menggunakan ``tor`` sistem di Linux"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:162
msgid ""
"First, install the ``tor`` package. If you're using Debian, Ubuntu, or a "
"similar Linux distro, It is recommended to use the Tor Project's `official "
"repository <https://support.torproject.org/apt/tor-deb-repo/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pertama, instal paket ``tor``. Jika Anda menggunakan Debian, Ubuntu, atau "
"distribusi Linux serupa, disarankan menggunakan `repositori resmi Tor "
"Project <https://support.torproject.org/apt/tor-deb-repo/>`_."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:164
msgid ""
"Next, add your user to the group that runs the ``tor`` process (in the case "
"of Debian and Ubuntu, ``debian-tor``) and configure OnionShare to connect to "
"your system ``tor``'s control socket file."
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, tambahkan pengguna Anda ke grup yang menjalankan proses ``tor``—"
"pada Debian dan Ubuntu, grup tersebut adalah ``debian-tor``—lalu "
"konfigurasikan OnionShare untuk terhubung ke file control socket ``tor`` "
"sistem Anda."

#: ../../source/tor.rst:166
msgid ""
"Add your user to the ``debian-tor`` group by running this command (replace "
"``username`` with your actual username)::"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan pengguna Anda ke grup ``debian-tor`` dengan menjalankan perintah "
"berikut (ganti ``username`` dengan nama pengguna Anda yang sebenarnya)::"

#: ../../source/tor.rst:170
msgid ""
"Reboot your computer. After it boots up again, open OnionShare, click the "
"\"⚙\" icon in it, and switch to the Tor Settings tab. Under \"How should "
"OnionShare connect to Tor?\" choose \"Connect using socket file\". Set the "
"socket file to be ``/var/run/tor/control``. Under \"Tor authentication "
"settings\" choose \"No authentication, or cookie authentication\". Click the "
"\"Test Connection to Tor\" button."
msgstr ""
"Nyalakan ulang komputer Anda. Setelah komputer menyala kembali, buka "
"OnionShare, klik ikon \"⚙\", lalu beralih ke tab Tor Settings. Pada bagian "
"\"How should OnionShare connect to Tor?\", pilih \"Connect using socket "
"file\". Atur file socket menjadi ``/var/run/tor/control``. Pada bagian \"Tor "
"authentication settings\", pilih \"No authentication, or cookie "
"authentication\". Klik tombol \"Test Connection to Tor\"."
